  "summary": "Malicious code in quartz-core (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook (node index.js) runs a DNS-based host-identity beacon on install. It reads the installer's username, hostname, and current working directory, encodes them into subdomains, and sends a DNS query of the form selftest.\u003cusername\u003e.\u003chostname\u003e.\u003ccwd\u003e.\u003ctimestamp\u003e.oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz to the attacker-controlled domain oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz. The host metadata is exfiltrated out-of-band over DNS, evading HTTP-based detection. The package has no repository and no declared purpose.",
